.TH DREADNOUGHT 1 "September 2026" "Dreadnought 0.2.0b2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dreadnought \- agent control plane with Grapher-backed project memory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dreadnought
.RI [ command ]
.br
.B dreadnought help
.br
.B dreadnought --help
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dreadnought coordinates project missions, agents, Grapher-backed knowledge, usage records, and compartmentalized project-arm work.
When run without arguments in an interactive terminal, Dreadnought presents an inline command-line menu rather than a full-screen interface.
.SH INTERACTIVE CONTROLS
.TP
.B Up / Down
Cycle through numbered menu choices.
.TP
.B 1..N
Select a menu item directly by number.
.TP
.B Enter
Accept the current selection.
.TP
.B q
Back out of or exit a menu.
.TP
.B Esc
Cancel the current text/confirmation prompt and exit cleanly.
.TP
.B Ctrl-C
Cancel the current text/confirmation prompt and exit cleanly.
.SH COMMON COMMANDS
.TP
.B dreadnought init
Guided project, Grapher, and primary-agent setup.
.TP
.B dreadnought mission build
Create a mission through the interactive mission builder.
.TP
.B dreadnought mission list
List known project missions.
.TP
.B dreadnought agent init
Configure a primary or minion agent.
.TP
.B dreadnought agent chat
Open the configured agent's native chat.
.TP
.B dreadnought grapher doctor
Check Dreadnought/Grapher compatibility.
.TP
.B dreadnought grapher query TEXT
Query the Grapher brain through Dreadnought's control plane.
.TP
.B dreadnought usage stats
Show aggregated token usage.
.TP
.B dreadnought update
Install an available Dreadnought release.
.TP
.B dreadnought help
Show top-level command help and interactive key controls.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I .dreadnought/config.json
Project-local Dreadnought configuration.
.TP
.I .dreadnought/missions/
Normalized mission records.
.TP
.I .grapher/
Project Grapher state controlled through Dreadnought.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grapher (1),
.BR git (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Dreadnought project contributors.
